{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Sentry Turret's Build/Deconstruct swap places no new button at level 10",
  "contract": [
    "Building a Sentry Turret swaps Build: Sentry Turret 500239 for Deconstruct 500470 through SMSG_SUPERCEDED_SPELL",
    "and tearing it down swaps back. Up to level 10 the client also places the spell a swap adds on an empty action",
    "button unless its Spell row's Rank text reads a rank above 1 (0x542D6E in the 3.3.5 client), so every swap",
    "added another Build or Deconstruct button (#6489). The server now sends the added spell's row with the Rank",
    "text 'Rank 2' just before the swap and its unchanged row right after. Expected over two cycles at level 10: both",
    "swaps reach the client, neither places a button, no line is printed, and each row reads its own rank again."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 90000,
  "location": {
    "map": 0,
    "x": -8917.41,
    "y": -115.853,
    "z": 82.3711,
    "o": 0
  },
  "players": [
